		(descr "Mask-open filled-via test point (D67): the board's 0.35/0.20 through via (D6), filled and capped (IPC-4761 Type VII), probed on its cap. SMD land D0.36 (0.005 past the via ring) with the test-point property and the mask opening on the placement side only (far side tented); PTH pad D0.35/0.20 with the Heatsink property so the D21 footprint_via_pads rules apply (via ring 0.075, via hole clearance 0.20). For bench recovery (EFM8 C2, SWD, FCB): needle probe <= 0.3 mm. No paste, no silk; listed in the pinout doc.")
